OL,3,GNEWSARobotic therapy helps patients
OL,4,Awalk at rehab centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new #105m NHS rehabilitation facility
OL,7,Fhas started using robotic technology to
OL,8,Fhelp patients learn to walk again.
OL,10,FThe National Rehabilitation Centre
OL,11,F(NRC) at Stanford Hall,
OL,12,FNottinghamshire, which opened on 2
OL,13,FSeptember, was created to help people
OL,14,Fwith life-changing illnesses or
OL,15,Finjuries achieve the best recovery
OL,16,Fpossible.
OL,18,FBrandon Wright, 22, and Nic Marsden,
OL,19,F29, who have both been undergoing
OL,20,Ftreatment at the centre, said the
OL,21,Fequipment had helped them to get back
OL,22,Fon their feet.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
